<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Learn British English</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #1d3557;
            --secondary: #457b9d;
            --accent: #e63946;
            --light: #f1faee;
            --dark: #1d3557;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem 1rem;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 2rem;
        }

        header p {
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            background-color: var(--secondary);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            padding: 1rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
        }

        .card h2 {
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .translation {
            color: #6c757d;
            font-style: italic;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            margin-top: -0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .vocab-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }

        .vocab-item {
            background: var(--light);
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--secondary);
        }

        audio {
            width: 100%;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .quiz-btn {
            background-color: var(--accent);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            width: 100%;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        .quiz-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            color: #6c757d;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Learn British English</h1>
        <p>Welcome! Step-by-step English lessons made for you.</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#level1">Level 1: Beginner</a>
        <a href="#level2">Level 2: Intermediate</a>
        <a href="#level3">Level 3: Advanced</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">

        <!-- LEVEL 1 SECTION -->
        <section id="level1">
            <div class="card">
                <h2>Lesson 1: Greetings & Basic Words</h2>
                <div class="translation">سلام و احوالپرسی / سلامونه او روغبړ</div>
                
                <p>Listen to the pronunciations below and practice repeating them out loud:</p>

                <div class="vocab-grid">
                    <div class="vocab-item">
                        <strong>Hello</strong>
                        <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #555;">(General Greeting)</div>
                        <!-- You can upload audio files later -->
                        <audio controls>
                            <source src="audio/hello.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
                            Your browser does not support audio.
                        </audio>
                    </div>

                    <div class="vocab-item">
                        <strong>Good morning</strong>
                        <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #555;">(Used before 12 PM)</div>
                        <audio controls>
                            <source src="audio/good-morning.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
                        </audio>
                    </div>

                    <div class="vocab-item">
                        <strong>How are you?</strong>
                        <div style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #555;">(Common question)</div>
                        <audio controls>
                            <source src="audio/how-are-you.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
                        </audio>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <h2>Practice & Quiz</h2>
                <p>What is the correct response to <em>"How are you?"</em></p>
                <button class="quiz-btn" onclick="alert('Correct! Standard response: I am fine, thank you!')">
                    Click to Check Answer
                </button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- LEVEL 2 SECTION -->
        <section id="level2" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
            <div class="card">
                <h2>Level 2: Everyday Conversations</h2>
                <p>Coming soon! Here we will cover asking for directions, shopping, and everyday UK phrases.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- LEVEL 3 SECTION -->
        <section id="level3" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
            <div class="card">
                <h2>Level 3: Intermediate & Grammar</h2>
                <p>Coming soon! We will cover reading passages, writing emails, and intermediate tenses.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>Made with ❤️ for my family in Afghanistan.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
